- one-byte and boundary-length inputs;
- lengths around internal block or chunk boundaries;
- known vectors or established reference outputs;
- streaming composition or round-trip properties;
- negative signed lengths;
- overflow and platform-width masking;
- agreement between the safe core and ABI wrapper for valid inputs.

Prefer adding a few focused tests rather than duplicating large fixtures or generated tables.

